Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The guard carries a heavy wooden weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We need that blunt weapon to break the rotten boards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.25,0:00:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It was probably the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My boots are soaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.75,0:00:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,AB 123 CD
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We should keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.25,0:00:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,CLOSE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I left my bag upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we are playing golf on the long course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The ball is far away; fetch the right piece of equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the club.
